# Mapsoo Worldforge's portable alpha and every dry-run require no environment
# variables.
#
# Optional remote execution reads exactly one runtime-only variable:
# OPENAI_API_KEY or SPRITECOOK_API_KEY.
#
# Never commit either value, put it in a job JSON, or paste it into an issue,
# prompt, receipt, Pack, or shell command. Configure it only in the private
# server/operator process that performs the explicitly authorized task.
